window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-050-39243c9eb518e50c.json"]={sha256:"39243c9eb518e50ce49d945a691c89cbc0bfbf9619e29c2ce9212b40790416fa",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-7083f52a7ebb2ce9","url":"https://www.grc.nasa.gov/www/wind/valid/tutorial/spatconv.html","title":"NASA tutorial on spatial convergence","titleEn":"NASA tutorial on spatial convergence","publisher":"NASA Glenn Research Center","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-050","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-050","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-051","referenceUrls":["https://www.mpi-forum.org/docs/mpi-4.1/mpi41-report.pdf"],"title":"MPI 網格分解：四面 halo 的通訊帳本","titleEn":"MPI domain decomposition: four-face halo accounting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付製造解驗證、三網格收斂表與效能驗收決策；兩段p=2可重算，誤差定義、漸近假設與未涵蓋物理限制都記錄；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver manufactured-solution checks, a three-grid convergence table, and a performance acceptance decision. Reproduce both observed orders of 2. Record the error norm, asymptotic assumption, and unmodeled physical limitations. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"以合成資料重建「MPI 網格分解：四面 halo 的通訊帳本」，能分離架構事實、模型假設與驗收證據。完成：交付 rank 網格、四面索引、兩種分解的流量與殘差比對表。","differenceEn":"Reconstruct MPI domain decomposition: four-face halo accounting with synthetic data; distinguish architecture facts, model assumptions and acceptance evidence. Complete: Deliver rank maps, four-face indices, traffic budgets for both decompositions and residual comparisons.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["若E(h)=Ch^p，網格間距縮半時p=log2(Eh/Eh/2)；需在漸近區且解/邊界一致；合成誤差E_h=.04、E_h/2=.01；另一組下一層誤差.0025，計相鄰兩段階數；名義式 log2(.04/.01) = 2 observed order；變更式 log2(.01/.0025) = 2 observed order。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","由全域尺寸推出 n=512，分別計算每面和四面 bytes，再列出同大小接收量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["If E(h) = C h^p, halving spacing gives p = log 2(E(h)/E(h/2)). This requires consistent boundaries and an asymptotic regime. Synthetic errors 0.04, 0.01, and 0.0025 at successively halved spacings. Calculate both adjacent observed orders. Nominal log2(.04/.01) = 2 observed order; changed log2(.01/.0025) = 2 observed order. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Derive n=512; calculate one-face and four-face bytes, then record equally sized receives.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-060","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/gpudirect-rdma/"],"title":"GPUDirect RDMA：拷貝路徑與 PCIe 下界","titleEn":"GPUDirect RDMA: copy paths and PCIe lower bounds","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付製造解驗證、三網格收斂表與效能驗收決策；兩段p=2可重算，誤差定義、漸近假設與未涵蓋物理限制都記錄；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver manufactured-solution checks, a three-grid convergence table, and a performance acceptance decision. Reproduce both observed orders of 2. Record the error norm, asymptotic assumption, and unmodeled physical limitations. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"以合成資料重建「GPUDirect RDMA：拷貝路徑與 PCIe 下界」，能分離架構事實、模型假設與驗收證據。完成：交付兩種資料路徑、時間下界、同步契約與相容性待確認清單。","differenceEn":"Reconstruct GPUDirect RDMA: copy paths and PCIe lower bounds with synthetic data; distinguish architecture facts, model assumptions and acceptance evidence. Complete: Deliver both data paths, time bounds, synchronization contracts and unresolved compatibility checks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["若E(h)=Ch^p，網格間距縮半時p=log2(Eh/Eh/2)；需在漸近區且解/邊界一致；合成誤差E_h=.04、E_h/2=.01；另一組下一層誤差.0025，計相鄰兩段階數；名義式 log2(.04/.01) = 2 observed order；變更式 log2(.01/.0025) = 2 observed order。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","以 8 GB 依序通過 32 與 25 GB/s 算時間，寫出採用十進位 GB。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["If E(h) = C h^p, halving spacing gives p = log 2(E(h)/E(h/2)). This requires consistent boundaries and an asymptotic regime. Synthetic errors 0.04, 0.01, and 0.0025 at successively halved spacings. Calculate both adjacent observed orders. Nominal log2(.04/.01) = 2 observed order; changed log2(.01/.0025) = 2 observed order. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Move 8 GB sequentially through 32 and 25 GB/s links, explicitly using decimal GB.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-245d4116a6090a19","url":"https://www.mpi-forum.org/docs/mpi-4.1/mpi41-report.pdf","title":"MPI 4.1 standard","titleEn":"MPI 4.1 standard","publisher":"MPI Forum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-6b0d49097a3b40af","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/gpudirect-rdma/","title":"GPUDirect RDMA overview","titleEn":"GPUDirect RDMA overview","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
